# Python scripts

- Prefix: `source .venv/bin/activate`
- Layout: `scripts/[task_name]/` only; read `scripts/script-index.md` before new tools
- Naming: full words (`detection_threshold` not `thresh`)
- PEP8; small functions; early returns
- Secrets: env vars only
- **Dataset safety:** never rename `.jpg` or `.txt` label files
- No local train, quant, or VELA (Colab `2025.07`, Python 3.11; cite `notebooks/*.ipynb`)
- Deploy artifact: `int8_vela.tflite` only (not plain `int8.tflite`)
